{"version":1,"content":"<p>據路透社報道，英偉達亞洲供應商、客户及其投資的初創企業對黃仁勳重新擔任公司CEO表示歡迎。多名業內人士認為，此舉有助於降低英偉達下一代產品規劃、供應鏈協作以及初創企業投資方向面臨的不確定性。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587840.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T11:24:03.196683+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":100,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T11:03:16+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:14.749424+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T11:17:14.749424+00:00","content_hash":"a3e34ef1c86e09003f94ee1e9f0e9da0a4fdc3beea3202cae9adf20c173b0b2d","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}